# Private planning documents. The privacy boundary applies to image layers
# exactly as it applies to commits, so these come first.
PLAN.md
STEPS.md
CLAUDE.md

# The registry and the generated populations arrive by read-only mount, not
# by copy: one registry stays the single source of truth, and the data is
# gigabytes that no image needs.
data/
data_manifests/
mlruns/
mlflow.db
tools/

